r>array<\/var> (16)<\/dt><dd><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>id<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1) \"3\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['id']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>sub_category_id<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1) \"4\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['sub_category_id']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>title<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (49) \"Koneksi Jaringan LAN Melambat atau Putus-Nyambung\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['title']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>symptoms<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (215) \"Akses internet maupun akses ke server lokal via kabel LAN terasa lambat tida...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['symptoms']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>Akses internet maupun akses ke server lokal via kabel LAN terasa lambat tidak wajar, sering mengalami Request Time Out (RTO) saat tes ping, atau status jaringan di taskbar berubah-ubah antara terhubung dan terputus.\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>root_cause<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (150) \"Port LAN pada router mengalami hang ringan (buffer\/negotiation port state st...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['root_cause']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>Port LAN pada router mengalami hang ringan (buffer\/negotiation port state stuck) atau konektor RJ45 pada kabel LAN kurang pas\/longgar pada soket port.\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>steps<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>UTF-8 string<\/var> (611) \"1. Telusuri jalur kabel LAN yang terhubung ke port pada Router atau Switch d...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['steps']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre>1. Telusuri jalur kabel LAN yang terhubung ke port pada Router atau Switch distribusi.\n2. Cabut kabel LAN dari port router secara perlahan dengan menekan klip pengunci konektor RJ45.\n3. Periksa ujung konektor RJ45 dan pastikan pin kuning tembaga bersih serta pengunci tidak patah.\n4. Tunggu selama 5&#8211;10 detik agar kapasitor dan state negosiasi pada port router benar-benar ter-reset.\n5. Pasang kembali kabel LAN ke port router hingga terdengar bunyi \"klik\" dan pastikan konektor terpasang rapat.\n6. Pastikan lampu indikator link\/activity pada port LAN menyala hijau\/oranye stabil dan lakukan uji ping kembali.\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>attachment<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>null<\/var><div class=\"access-path\">$value['attachment']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>is_pinned<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1) \"1\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['is_pinned']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>created_at<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (19) \"2026-11-18 09:38:11\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['created_at']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>updated_at<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (19) \"2026-11-18 09:38:11\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['updated_at']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>sub_category_name<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (12) \"Router \/ LAN\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['sub_category_name']<\/div><\/dt><\/dl><dl><dt><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\"><\/span><dfn>sub_category_slug<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (10) \"router-lan\"<div class=\"access-path\">$value['sub_category_slug']<\/div